      "notes": "REAL CVE: Linux nilfs2 GC use-after-free. bh freed via brelse() before bh->b_page dereferenced in nilfs_gccache_submit_read_data(). Fix: reordered access before free. Ubuntu advisory. [SENTINEL]",
